    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >METAL STRIKE - Retake Our Planet</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Background</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 2XXX, humanity was finally expelled from the Earth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AI has chosen to kick its owner out of the planet to survive amid severe pollution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humanity has effectively fallen, but after years of seclusion and exile, four people finally gathered in one place to reclaim the Earth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Characteristics</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- a third-person shooting game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427010/extras/d673317b4aff4e23ce5de82990303fc4.poster.avif?t=1738734388\" width=384 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427010/extras/d673317b4aff4e23ce5de82990303fc4.webm?t=1738734388\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427010/extras/d673317b4aff4e23ce5de82990303fc4.mp4?t=1738734388\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Support for up to 4-player multi-play</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Four guns to suit your taste</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427010/extras/2b3fc442739df90308c93b3f872aad4f.poster.avif?t=1738734388\" width=384 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427010/extras/2b3fc442739df90308c93b3f872aad4f.webm?t=1738734388\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427010/extras/2b3fc442739df90308c93b3f872aad4f.mp4?t=1738734388\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Cool annihilation mission and urgent boss mission</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427010/extras/e7c9da38acf8b00742d8cf6841941454.poster.avif?t=1738734388\" width=384 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427010/extras/e7c9da38acf8b00742d8cf6841941454.webm?t=1738734388\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427010/extras/e7c9da38acf8b00742d8cf6841941454.mp4?t=1738734388\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Objectives</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Kill all enemies in the annihilation battle of Stage 1, board the helicopter, and infiltrate the enemy base.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Eliminate the culprit of the incident in Stage 2, the enemy base, and reclaim Earth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- If the difficulty is too high, cooperate with your teammates and use the resurrection system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427010/extras/00fa588fc470f8a97f9a5448b3acc1a6.poster.avif?t=1738734388\" width=384 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427010/extras/00fa588fc470f8a97f9a5448b3acc1a6.webm?t=1738734388\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427010/extras/00fa588fc470f8a97f9a5448b3acc1a6.mp4?t=1738734388\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How to operate</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >moving: WASD</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump: Space</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sitting: Ctrl</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Running: Shift (while pressing)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dash: WASD No. 2 consecutive hits</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attack: Left-click</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zoom-in: right-click</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >reloading: R</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replace gun mode: B</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throwing the gun away: Tap long</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interaction / Item Acquisition: F</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When replacing a firearm: Get a replacement firearm after discarding your firearm</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features by gun mode</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- a rifle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mode: basic, continuous (basic damage)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >B mode: 3-point scanning (high damage)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Shotgun</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mode: Basic, high elasticity, basic range (basic damage)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >B mode: Reduced bullet spread, reduced range (basic damage)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- a machine gun</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mode: Basic, movable (basic damage)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >B mode: No movement when fired, (high damage)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Rocket launcher</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mode: Basic, low launch speed (basic damage)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >B mode: 3 consecutive rounds, high firing speed (low damage)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for providing the Cinematic Music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >shimtone - Viper</p>",
